机位，多角度场景，非固定视角，景深变化，环境多角度变化\n动作4：靠墙自然站立，轻撩头发，姿态松弛随性，突出服装日常百搭、舒适耐看。\n动作5：全身照，女性自然站姿，重心偏向一侧的松弛S型体态，一只手轻轻提起裙摆侧边，手指自然搭在裙边，不僵硬不攥紧，另一只手自然垂在身侧，肩膀放松，柔和微笑，表情自然不刻意\n动作6：侧身站姿侧身 45° 面对镜头，一手轻扶腰侧，展现侧面线条、肩型、收腰效果与衣身垂感。\n动作7：正面半身构图，双脚微开与肩同宽，身体微侧，双手自然垂放，表情自然。然多变微表情，神态松弛。多变镜头角度，随机透视，不同拍摄机位，多角度场景，非固定视角，景深变化，环境多角度变化\n动作8：正面半身构图，双手自然轻抱在胸前，或一手轻搭在另一只手臂上，姿态放松随性", 0, 17, ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 50, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}, {"widget": {"name": "start_index"}, "name": "start_index", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "起始索引"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_rows"}, "name": "max_rows", "link": 72, "type": "INT", "localized_name": "最大行数"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptLine", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [461.3612976074219, 476.2864074707031], "pos": [-292.5022888183594, 594.7657470703125], "id": 34, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy promptLine"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [58], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314], "pos": [-795.8099975585938, 1112.7728271484375], "widgets_values": ["None", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 38, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [64], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [270, 130], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [221.55853271484375, 829.6204833984375], "widgets_values": ["", "", "", ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text_1"}, "name": "text_1", "link": 48, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "tex